        <h3 style="font-family:'Nunito Sans',sans-serif;font-size:18px;font-weight:800;color:#0A3D5C;margin:0 0 8px;">EF5 Rated Protection</h3>
        <p style="font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#555;margin:0;">Each safe room is built to withstand the extreme forces of an EF5 tornado, providing unparalleled safety for you and your loved ones.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="background:#fff;border:1px solid #e3ded4;border-radius:10px;padding:26px;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(14,77,110,0.05);">
        <h3 style="font-family:'Nunito Sans',sans-serif;font-size:18px;font-weight:800;color:#0A3D5C;margin:0 0 8px;">Modular Steel Construction</h3>
        <p style="font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#555;margin:0;">Our safe rooms feature heavy-duty modular steel panels, allowing for flexible sizing and secure installation within existing structures.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="background:#fff;border:1px solid #e3ded4;border-radius:10px;padding:26px;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(14,77,110,0.05);">
        <h3 style="font-family:'Nunito Sans',sans-serif;font-size:18px;font-weight:800;color:#0A3D5C;margin:0 0 8px;">Wheelchair Accessible</h3>
        <p style="font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#555;margin:0;">Designed with accessibility in mind, our above ground units offer easy entry and exit, making them ideal for all family members, including those with mobility challenges.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="background:#fff;border:1px solid #e3ded4;border-radius:10px;padding:26px;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(14,77,110,0.05);">
        <h3 style="font-family:'Nunito Sans',sans-serif;font-size:18px;font-weight:800;color:#0A3D5C;margin:0 0 8px;">Interior & Garage Installs</h3>
        <p style="font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#555;margin:0;">These versatile shelters can be securely anchored in various locations, including inside closets, utility rooms, or directly within your garage.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="background:#fff;border:1px solid #e3ded4;border-radius:10px;padding:26px;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(14,77,110,0.05);">
        <h3 style="font-family:'Nunito Sans',sans-serif;font-size:18px;font-weight:800;color:#0A3D5C;margin:0 0 8px;">FEMA P-320 & ICC-500 Compliant</h3>
        <p style="font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#555;margin:0;">We ensure all our above ground safe rooms meet or exceed the rigorous safety guidelines set by FEMA P-320 and ICC-500 standards.</p>
